RoxieOS base system configuration and setup utilities.

This package provides essential system configuration for RoxieOS,
including:

- OS release identification (/usr/local/share/roxieos/os-release)
- BAUX keymap with Caps Lock → Escape globally
- Autologin setup for tty1
- X11 autostart configuration with keymap loading
- Font management and nerd font installation
- System integration scripts

